{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>All of them</b> — returns to the creatures of the earth, and also the sea, because he mentioned that Leviathan plays in it, for its food is prepared. He said: for all of them look — to HaShem, or each one, because he needs it or because it is his way."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 104, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:15.886630232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}